When so many races and species interact with each other on a daily basis, racism is an inescapable fact of life. Here is the list of slurs by race that one may encounter.
[ {"title" : "Anyone who isn't water breathing","list" : ["Drowner","Landdweller","Landwalker","Mouth-Breather"]},
{"title" : "Indirect Racial Slurs","list" : ["A bag of leftovers from a restaurant: \"<em>An Orc-y Bag</em>\"","A dagger/knife: \"<em>A Gnomish Greatsword</em>\"","Bad breath: \"<em>Dragonborn Singing</em>\"","Barrels of whiskey: \"<em>Dwarven Wetnurse</em>\"","Happy endings at a massage parlor: \"<em>Human Style</em>\"","Laying a dwarf or gnome: \"<em>Boulder Rolling</em>\"","Picking a lock: \"<em>Banging a Halfling's Sister</em>\"","Pickpocketing: \"<em>Halfing Handshake</em>\"","Public drunkenness: \"<em>Going Dwarven</em>\"","Stealing a horse/car: \"<em>Taking a Half-Orc Bride</em>\"","The act of going barefoot: \"<em>Wearing Halfling Shoes</em>\" (some stores have signs forbidding halfling shoes)","The bastard children of non-human races: \"<em>Half-Man</em>\"","Unshaven men: \"<em>Dwarf Babies</em>\"","Vegetables: \"<em>Elf Food</em>\"","Whiskey: \"<em>Dwarf Milk</em>\""]},
{ "title" : "Non-Dragonborn"(By Dragonborn),"list" : ["Maunthreki"]},
{"title" : "Non-Drow"(By Drow),"list" : ["Iblith (meaning excrement)"]}
]
